# Salesforce project default org

Copy this file to `.cursor/rules/sfdc-default-org.mdc` in each Salesforce DX project.

When working in this repository:

1. Run: `python3 ~/.cursor/skills/_shared/show-context.py`
2. Use `targetOrgAlias` from output for all `sf` commands (`--target-org`)
3. Default org = `.sf/config.json` → `target-org` (project-local, set when you configure the sandbox for this folder)
4. Never hardcode org aliases — re-resolve when switching projects
